<h1 data-copy-en="Talena" data-copy-zh="Talena">Talena</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Room visits, Band Clout, drum accuracy and the personal invitation." data-copy-zh="房间探访、乐队声望、鼓曲准确率与个人邀请。">Room visits, Band Clout, drum accuracy and the personal invitation.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Beast_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Apartment_Branches_and_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Intimate_Evening_Unlock_and_Frequency"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Closer_Heart-to-Heart"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Rockband_Night"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Band_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Personal_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Drum_Accuracy_and_Clout"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Band_Progression_and_Recommended_Order"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Talena — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/talena.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Talena — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/talena.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Talena — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Talena’s practical route combines Band Clout, room conversations and a recorded drum-song result. Her Improvisation affinity is not a skill lesson she offers.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats_and_Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>The Music Studio opens 11:00–23:00. Talena’s studio portrait is 14:00–18:00, but all seven personal actions are in Talena’s Room, where she is 12:00–14:00 and 18:00–23:00. Entering or leaving the room takes 0 minutes and has no additional relationship gate.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Music Studio</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talena's Room</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">12:00–14:00 / 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Band Clout 10 triggers her first studio event and gives 10 base affection, opening ordinary Talk at Acknowledged (10). Room events then use their own Known (25) and Friend (100) requirements. Keep Up needs Band Clout 26; the playable Drum and Bass Jam instead unlocks at Band Clout 30.</p><p>At Crush (400), start Closer in her room 20:00–23:00. For Intimate Evening, complete that H2H and record at least 80% accuracy on Drum and Bass Jam in Normal or Chill Mode. Practice Mode records no best result and cannot satisfy the check.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Bassist's Nod</th><td data-label="Requirements">Music Studio; Band Clout 10</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Talena +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Just Around</th><td data-label="Requirements">Talena's Room; 12:00–14:00 or 18:00–23:00; The Bassist's Nod</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Talena +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What It Means</th><td data-label="Requirements">Talena's Room; Talena Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Talena +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">On Her Own</th><td data-label="Requirements">Talena's Room; Talena Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Talena +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Keep Up</th><td data-label="Requirements">Music Studio; Band Clout 26</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Talena +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Creative Differences</th><td data-label="Requirements">Music Studio; Band Clout 20; Cotton Acknowledged (10); Talena Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Long and Loud</th><td data-label="Requirements">Music Studio; Band Clout 25; Cotton Friend (100); Talena Friend (100); Nyx Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cotton +6; Talena +6; Nyx +6</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Room_Actions"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Talena</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Talena's Room; Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Talena's Room; Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Flowers</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+5 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Wine</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Talena's Room; Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Wine</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Lingerie</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Talena's Room; Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Lingerie</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rockband Night</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Talena's Room; Friend (100); 18:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $80; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Closer</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Talena's Room; Crush (400); 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Evening</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Talena's Room; Crush (400); Closer; 20:00–23:00; recorded Drum and Bass Jam accuracy ≥80% in Normal or Chill Mode; Practice Mode does not count</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; repeatable within the start window</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Practice Drums is the studio’s separate location activity, 12:00–23:00, costing $30, 25 minutes and 20 Energy when a session is committed. Leaving song selection before committing does not charge. Rockband Night is a separate one-time Friend (100) date, 18:00–21:00, $80, 120 minutes and 35 Energy.</p><p>Intimate Evening really spends 120 minutes and 50 Energy and starts 20:00–23:00. It is repeatable while those conditions hold. Its affection follows the chosen conversation path; it is not a guaranteed flat reward.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 before ordinary affection bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount. An affinity is not itself a lesson offered by this character.</p><p>Stamina 50; Ability 55; Perception 50</p><p>Favorite skill: Improvisation</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection, player experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate. Conversation choices can add rewards beyond event-completion affection.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><p>Use the room, not the studio portrait, for Talk, gifts and personal invitations. A free Practice Mode score does not count toward Intimate Evening. Band Clout 26 and 30 open different content; do not stop at the personal event threshold when you need the song.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and affection</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Skills</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-music-and-rhythm.html">Drums and song progression</a></li><li><a href="character-cotton.html">Cotton</a></li><li><a href="character-nyx.html">Nyx</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Beast_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Apartment_Branches_and_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Intimate_Evening_Unlock_and_Frequency"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Closer_Heart-to-Heart"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Rockband_Night"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Band_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Personal_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Drum_Accuracy_and_Clout"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Band_Progression_and_Recommended_Order"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Talena 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/talena.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Talena 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/talena.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Talena 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Talena 的推进结合乐队声望、房间谈话与已记录的鼓曲成绩。她偏好的即兴发挥并不代表她会教授该技能。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats_and_Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>音乐工作室营业时段为 11:00–23:00。Talena 的工作室肖像在 14:00–18:00 出现，但七项个人行动全部位于 Talena的房间，她在房间的时段为 12:00–14:00 与 18:00–23:00。进出房间均耗时 0 分钟，没有额外关系入口条件。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">音乐工作室</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talena的房间</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">12:00–14:00／18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>乐队声望 10 可触发首次工作室事件，给予 10 基础好感度，达到已遇见（10）后即可普通交谈。房间事件随后分别检查已知（25）与朋友（100）。工作室后续节点要求乐队声望 26；可玩的鼓与贝斯合奏则在乐队声望 30 开放。</p><p>迷恋（400）后，可在房间 20:00–23:00 进行更近一步谈心。亲密夜晚还要求该谈心完成，并在普通或轻松模式的鼓与贝斯合奏留下至少 80% 准确率纪录。练习模式不保存最佳成绩，不能满足此项条件。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">贝斯手的点头</th><td data-label="条件">音乐工作室; 乐队声望 10</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Talena +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">就在附近</th><td data-label="条件">Talena的房间; 12:00–14:00 或 18:00–23:00; 贝斯手的点头</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Talena +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">它的意义</th><td data-label="条件">Talena的房间; Talena 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Talena +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">独自前行</th><td data-label="条件">Talena的房间; Talena 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Talena +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">跟上</th><td data-label="条件">音乐工作室; 乐队声望 26</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Talena +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">创作分歧</th><td data-label="条件">音乐工作室; 乐队声望 20; Cotton 已遇见 (10); Talena 已遇见 (10)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">又长又响</th><td data-label="条件">音乐工作室; 乐队声望 25; Cotton 朋友 (100); Talena 朋友 (100); Nyx 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cotton +6; Talena +6; Nyx +6</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Room_Actions"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><details><summary>行动消耗、条件与奖励</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Talena 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Talena的房间; 已遇见 (10)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 5次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Talena的房间; 相识 (50)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; 1 鲜花</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+5 基础好感度; 2次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送葡萄酒</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Talena的房间; 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; 1 葡萄酒</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 基础好感度; 2次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送贴身衣物</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Talena的房间; 亲密朋友 (200)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; 1 内衣</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+10 基础好感度; 2次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">摇滚乐队之夜</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Talena的房间; 朋友 (100); 18:00–21:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $80; −35 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更近一步</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Talena的房间; 迷恋 (400); 20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力; +10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">好感度由对话选择决定；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密夜晚</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Talena的房间; 迷恋 (400); 更近一步; 20:00–23:00; 鼓与贝斯合奏在普通或轻松模式留下 ≥80% 准确率纪录；练习模式不计</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; −50 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">好感度由对话选择决定；在开始时段内可重复</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>练习架子鼓是工作室独立地点活动，时段为 12:00–23:00；正式开始一局时消耗 $30、25 分钟与 20 精力，在确认前退出选曲不会扣费。摇滚乐队之夜是独立的一次性朋友（100）约会，时段 18:00–21:00，消耗 $80、120 分钟与 35 精力。</p><p>亲密夜晚会实际消耗 120 分钟与 50 精力，开始时段为 20:00–23:00，条件仍满足时可重复。好感度取决于选择的谈话路线，不是保证固定数值。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。偏好技能本身不代表该角色会教授它。</p><p>耐力 50; 能力 55; 感知 50</p><p>偏好技能：即兴发挥</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择可能在事件完成好感度之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><p>交谈、送礼与个人邀请请去房间，不要只点工作室肖像。免费练习模式的分数不计入亲密夜晚条件。乐队声望 26 与 30 开放的内容不同，需要歌曲时不能只停在个人事件门槛。</p></section>
